eting &amp; event planning. Having a successful meeting involves a strong collaboration with clients, peers and vendors. I have managed Pharma Investigator Meetings and Advisory Board Meetings in the USA, Latin America, Asia, Australia and Europe. I am happy to add another continent. Let’s go! &nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text\">​</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">My work history starts in hotel hospitality. In my mind, the best training to prepare a person in this industry is to work at the front desk at a busy hotel. Throw in the graveyard shift! For over a decade, I have worked in the entertainment business. I consider myself fortunate to have developed strong relationships throughout my professional journey.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:futura-lt-w01-book,futura-lt-w05-book,sans-serif;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Outside of work, I enjoy time with friends and family which includes several fur babies. I am known to pull over when I see a stray dog. I also help rescue and TNR cats. The neighborhood kids are now calling me the Cat Lady. &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p></div><div id=\"comp-lf2xuc961\" class=\"comp-lf2xuc961 wixui-image-button\" aria-describedby=\"7da45ab6-163e-4b92-9a07-faf12c12a2b2\"><a data-testid=\"link\" href=\"mailto:nora@reachmeetings.com\" target=\"_self\" class=\"QP6ZLS z9LPSw\" aria-label=\"\" tabindex=\"0\"><div role=\"img\" class=\"nXJ9tS\" data-testid=\"linkImageContainer\"><div class=\"PRnra1\"><img id=\"i